WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:11.870
my key in the dragons by jakka Willick
drawings by John Bozak

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:22.869
this book is dedicated to Mikey Mark
Ryan Chris and Seth who went into the

00:00:22.869 --> 00:00:34.210
fray and fought the Dragons there once
was a little boy named Mike and there

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:38.140
were many things in the world
that he didn't like he was scared of

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:44.410
spiders and beetles and bugs and always
thought they hid under the rugs they

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:49.750
were creepy and crawly and nasty and
mean and he ran from every bug he had

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:55.059
ever seen but it wasn't only insects
that gave Mikey a scare there were many

00:00:55.059 --> 00:01:00.940
other things for which Mike didn't care
he left the light on when he went to

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:07.149
sleep at night he was scared there were
monsters ready to bite hidden in his

00:01:07.149 --> 00:01:12.039
closet or under his bed and he thought
they might get him when he laid down his

00:01:12.039 --> 00:01:19.630
head he imagined a monster with giant
teeth and claws grabbing his neck with

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:26.020
its giant paws and if it wasn't monsters
coming to take him away it would be

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:33.820
slimy snakes slithering his way yes
Mikey was scared of evil snakes too he

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:39.820
was horrified of what they could do they
could sneak in the house and hide in his

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:45.640
drawer and then bite him to bits of that
he was sure there were many other things

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:51.040
that gave Mikey a scare which meant
there were many things that he wouldn't

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:54.759
dare he didn't like the water or to go
for a swim

00:01:54.759 --> 00:02:00.310
he was scared that giant sharks might
come and get him he didn't like the

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:05.950
playground with ladders and slides he
thought if he fell off he would surely

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:10.990
die yes as you can see things for Mikey
were bad

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:17.830
and being afraid made Mike very sad
because so many things scared Mike to

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:24.010
the bone it turns out that Mikey was
often alone he would sit by himself and

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:30.490
look at the sky and then he would
quietly ask himself why why did so many

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:36.280
things give him a scare how could he
ever overcome all that fear how could he

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:42.240
ever stand up and be brave or would
being afraid always make him a slave and

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:48.940
then one day Mikey noticed a book he
opened it up and took a quick look it

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:53.530
had pictures of dragons with fangs like
a snake and all kinds of scary things

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:59.860
that made Mikey shake but in the
pictures there was a boy - who didn't

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:03.340
look scared
but like he knew what to do and even

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:07.540
though Mikey was scared indeed he
decided that he would give the book a

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:14.770
read he opened the first page which he
eagerly read and this is what the Dragon

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:22.870
books said that once was a kingdom long
ago and far away and the kingdom had

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:28.720
suffered a horrible day their protector
and leader their King he had died and

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:34.900
when they found out the whole village
cried when the King was alive he was a

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:42.460
powerful force now they took the dead
king away by carriage and horse they

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:46.480
knew they would miss him and that made
them sad but there was something else

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:51.670
that made them feel bad the king had
always been so strong and brave and

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:57.220
protected the kingdom from the dragon
cave the dragon cave was just over the

00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:03.850
hill and filled with scary creatures
that were ready to kill horrible dragons

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:08.980
of every single type who thought people
in the kingdom were especially ripe the

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:13.930
people thought the Dragons had wrath of
fire and that the dragon stood twenty

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:17.660
feet tall or higher they thought the
Dragons had

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:25.640
sword stopping scales and powerful long
razor-sharp tails but the brave King

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:32.930
never let their beasts around he stood
up and fought and held his ground and as

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:38.570
long as the king had been the king
none of the Dragons could do a thing yes

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:44.900
the king always kept the dragons at bay
by going out bravely into the fray it

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:50.480
seemed without fear the king would go
fight he beat the Dragons and come home

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:58.160
at night but now that the king had died
and was gone there was only one person

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:04.430
to fight and carry on but that person
wasn't big or mighty or strong in fact

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:10.820
he hadn't been alive that long now the
person who had dragons to chase was just

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:17.240
a little boy with a smiling face yes the
person that now must stand up and be

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:23.930
bold was just the little prince who was
only seven years old then the people in

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:28.190
the village just couldn't be sure that
this young boy the little prince could

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:33.740
endure how could someone so young and so
small stand up to the mighty dragons

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:42.050
that were so tall and the prince himself
he also didn't know if he had the

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:47.390
courage it would take to go because he
was so little and small and young he

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:54.020
didn't know if he could get the job done
how could he make the mean dragons yield

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:59.650
when he could barely lift a sword or a
shield

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:05.350
but no one else dared to step up and
fight not the kingdoms guards or even

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:10.810
the Knights so even though the prince
was scared he still knew that fighting

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:17.020
the Dragons was something he must do so
he went to the Kings bedroom and opened

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:23.169
the door and went inside and walked
across the floor he opened an old chest

00:06:23.169 --> 00:06:30.820
that was tall and wide where the king
had kept all his war gear inside the

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:35.949
shield was big and the sword was so long
it was no wonder the King had been so

00:06:35.949 --> 00:06:43.180
strong but the prince was a boy not a
king like his dad and to lift up the

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:48.669
gear took all the strength of the boy
hand and that made the prince did even

00:06:48.669 --> 00:06:54.280
more nervous and he wondered if he was
ready for this service fighting dragons

00:06:54.280 --> 00:07:00.520
was such a scary task the prince to
himself had some questions to ask how

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:06.340
could a little boy ever be a man how
could the little prince ever make a

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:12.910
stand but at the bottom of the chest
there was a small note and it looked

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:18.880
like something that the king wrote so
just when the Prince thought he was over

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:25.960
and done he picked up the note and it
said to my son he took a deep breath and

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:31.270
open the note he had found and this is
what his father the King had written

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:39.870
down to my son
if you are reading this now it means I

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:47.219
am gone and you are the one that must
carry on our kingdom is now what you

00:07:47.219 --> 00:07:54.659
must save and to do that you have to be
brave I know that you think you don't

00:07:54.659 --> 00:08:02.189
know what to do but remember that I was
once a little boy - I was also small and

00:08:02.189 --> 00:08:06.719
had fear in my heart and I didn't even
know where to start

00:08:06.719 --> 00:08:14.000
I couldn't imagine going over the hill
to face the dragons that wanted to kill

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:20.879
but don't worry son you will be just
fine if you can keep these things in

00:08:20.879 --> 00:08:25.139
your mind
the dragons they aren't really that big

00:08:25.139 --> 00:08:31.259
at all it is only in our minds that we
make them so tall inside our brains

00:08:31.259 --> 00:08:38.909
things always get overblown especially
things that are completely unknown but

00:08:38.909 --> 00:08:43.860
when fear settles in and gets a hold of
you here are some things that you simply

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:51.600
must do stand up straight and hold your
head high and look your fears right in

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:58.050
the eye don't look away and don't try to
hide know that you have great strength

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:03.830
deep inside when you stand up and go
into the frame

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:11.930
your fears start to go away and though
there will be horror you feel the things

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:18.770
you are scare that are not a big deal
this is not to say you won't feel a

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:26.120
scare fear is a feeling that all of us
share fear is normal for every person on

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:34.640
earth but this is where a hero proves
his worth a coward runs away but danger

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:41.150
is near but a hero will face the thing
that they fear so that is what you must

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:48.440
do my son face the Dragons and do not
run and I promise when you meet them you

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:56.690
will see that you are just as strong as
me the dragons that seemed so mighty and

00:09:56.690 --> 00:10:03.590
mean or not ever as bad as they might
see and most of the things that fill you

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:15.560
with dread are usually just made up in
your head your father the king now the

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:20.870
boy was still scared though not as bad
after he got done reading the note from

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:26.870
his dad the next day he got up and began
to get ready he was still scared but the

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:32.630
note kept his mind steady of course he
still felt some fear in his mind but he

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:38.510
knew he would have to keep it confined
and despite all the fear he had had he

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:44.750
knew he needed to listen to his dad so
he picked up the shields and picked up

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:50.300
the sword and held up his chin and went
out the door the people of the kingdom

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:56.180
knew where he was going and the crowd in
the streets it just kept growing they

00:10:56.180 --> 00:11:01.310
stood and they cheered and they shouted
and smiled and hoped the kingdom would

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:07.130
be saved by this child
and the prince gave them a crisp salute

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:13.430
as he marched past them all down the
main route and at the end he stood up

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:20.180
very straight and then he simply walked
out of the gate once outside of the

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:26.269
kingdom he tried to stay brave as he
walks toward the dragon cave he could

00:11:26.269 --> 00:11:32.269
smell the fire of their breath and
wondered if he would meet his death but

00:11:32.269 --> 00:11:37.310
he remembered what his father had said
that most of the fear was inside his

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:43.279
head when he got near the cave he looked
all around but he saw no dragons upon

00:11:43.279 --> 00:11:48.680
the ground so he walked closer and then
heard some noise and though it scared

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:54.560
him a bit he still kept his poise then
he got to the edge of the cave and

00:11:54.560 --> 00:12:00.709
looked in and saw countless numbers of
dragons within but when the dragon saw

00:12:00.709 --> 00:12:06.769
him they scattered and hid even though
the prince was just a little kid and the

00:12:06.769 --> 00:12:11.690
prince II couldn't believe his eyes
because to the princes great surprise

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:18.230
the dragons though many were small as
could be in fact they only came up to

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:24.740
his knee and when they breathed fire it
was just a tiny flame that any little

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:29.750
matchstick could put to shame and their
teeth were very sharp and white and

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:36.440
shiny but they were also so very tiny
the teeth they had were as small as a

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:41.630
pin and wouldn't even bite through the
princes skin so the Prince walked right

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:46.880
into the cave just as a prince and a
king should behave and one small dragon

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:52.339
came out looking sweet and sat on the
ground at the princes feet and the

00:12:52.339 --> 00:12:56.899
prince was convinced by this little
sight that his father the Great King was

00:12:56.899 --> 00:13:01.370
absolutely right
the fear was just like the king had said

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:08.440
and had all been in the princes head
so the prince left the cave and headed

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:13.660
back to town and all the people saw him
come down they clapped their hands and

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:19.090
shouted with joy that the kingdom had
been saved by this boy the Prince

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:25.930
climbed up and stood on the wall and
this is what he told them all there

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:32.140
really is no reason for dread all of the
fear is just in your head the Dragons

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:37.690
they can do nothing to us and there
really is no reason to fuss so have no

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:42.400
fear of a dragon attack
in fact the Dragons will never be back

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:48.160
and with that all of the townspeople
cheered because the prince had quelled

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:53.620
the thing they most feared and the
Prince tried to tell them the dragons

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:58.930
were smaller but they wouldn't listen to
him at all so the Prince carried on

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:04.750
protecting the town and of course he
never let them down because the dragons

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:10.510
were so small they really were no threat
at all and the kingdom carried on

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:18.730
forever filled with laughter all of the
people lived happily ever after and that

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:25.300
was the end of the Dragon book and Mikey
was so glad he had taken a look he

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:30.880
realized something that he never knew if
you are afraid there are things you can

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:36.790
do instead of hiding or running away
stand up and face what makes you afraid

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:42.280
and from that day forth
Mikey changed his mind and left his

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:48.250
fears and his worries behind even when
he was afraid of something out there he

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:53.770
knew how to get control of this fear he
would stand up straight and hold his

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:58.810
head high and like the Prince look his
fear in the eye

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:03.370
and that is always the best thing to do
if there is something that really scares

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:09.670
you don't get controlled by feelings of
dread remember most of the fear is just

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:16.390
in your head this isn't to say you won't
be afraid but you should know that fear

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:22.270
is okay everyone gets nervous and has a
good scare and feels like they're going

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:29.320
into the dragon's lair but when that
happens and you don't want to go think

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:34.780
of the lesson the prince got to know
that when you are feeling so scared of

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:46.350
it all you just need to remember that
the Dragons are small the end

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.860
you

